/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Reconstructing\040Proto\055Indo\055European\040Deponents)
/Author (Laura\040Grestenberger)
/Subject (This\040paper\040argues\040that\040the\040Proto\055Indo\055European\040voice\040system\054\040despite\040undergoing\040several\040waves\040of\040morphological\040renewal\040on\040the\040way\040to\040the\040daughter\040languages\040\050Jasanoff\0402003\051\054\040was\040typologically\040that\040of\040early\040IE\040languages\040like\040Vedic\040and\040Greek\054\040and\040contemporary\040languages\040such\040as\040Modern\040Greek\054\040and\040that\040the\040syncretic\040voice\040systems\040of\040these\040languages\040share\040the\040property\040of\040having\040deponents\056\040While\040previous\040discussions\040of\040middle\055only\040verbs\040have\040focused\040on\040a\040few\040morphologically\040archaic\040but\040semantically\040unsurprising\040middles\054\040I\040show\040that\040PIE\040also\040had\040agentive\054\040syntactically\040active\040middles\040that\040escaped\040the\040expected\040remodeling\040as\040formally\040active\040verbs\040and\040surface\040as\040deponents\040in\040the\040IE\040daughter\040branches\056\040Reconstructing\040verbs\040with\040\215unexpected\216\040voice\040morphology\040may\040seem\040counter\055intuitive\054\040but\040is\040necessary\040to\040cover\040the\040empirical\040facts\040and\040may\040also\040serve\040as\040a\040diagnostic\040for\040the\040relative\040chronology\040of\040the\040morphological\040innovations\040that\040occurred\040in\040the\040domain\040of\040PIE\040voice\040morphology\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402016\054\040Modern\040Greek\054\040Indo\055European\040languages)
>>
endobj
